      "dcterms:rights": "DRAFT — Source: Riigi Teataja (https://www.riigiteataja.ee). Statutory text is excluded from copyright under §5 Autoriõiguse seadus (not an object of copyright). VERIFY: the consolidated machine-readable product and a sui generis database right may still carry Riigi Teataja reuse/API terms — check live terms before redistribution. Compilation layer (links, IRIs, structure) offered under CC BY 4.0. See NOTICE / docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md.",
